Variances between panel members' comparative judgements.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
MCDM methods often support group decisions.
 This requires eliciting comparative judgements from a range of experts.
 Panel members will generally provide differing ordering preferences and importance intensities.
 Based on 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
