LatexCommand href
name "Table 6"
target "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0196890425014761?via%3Dihub#t0030"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 in 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "Bu2026"
literal "false"

\end_inset

.
 Reproducing the common result with higher numerical precision,
 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
